## B1: PORT=9090 with the pipe still at 8080, then the fix
$ docker run -d --name l14ex-port --rm -e PORT=9090 -p 18086:8080 l14ex/translation-demo:local >/dev/null; echo started
started
[exit 0]

$ curl -sS http://localhost:18086/
curl: (52) Empty reply from server
[exit 52]

$ docker logs l14ex-port 2>&1 | grep -E 'Starting|Listening'
