[2026-11-04 10:56:44 +0000] [1] [INFO] Listening at: http://0.0.0.0:9090 (1)
[exit 0]

$ docker stop l14ex-port >/dev/null; echo stopped
stopped
[exit 0]

$ docker run -d --name l14ex-port --rm -e PORT=9090 -p 18086:9090 l14ex/translation-demo:local >/dev/null; echo started
started
[exit 0]

$ curl -s http://localhost:18086/ | grep -o '<title>.*</title>'
<title>Translate · AC215</title>
